+++++++# Root Cause Analyst's final recommendation
+++++++
+++++++Correct only the calculation producer (`app.component.ts` or a calculation-specific pure helper) so it emits:
+++++++
+++++++`base64(JSON.stringify(Array.from(pako.gzip(json))))`
