++- Dependencies: existing DuckDB/httpx cache path, FastAPI, RequestCoordinator, Lightweight Charts 4.2.0, native ES modules, pytest, and node:test; no new dependency or migration.
++- Complexity: COMPLEX.
++
++### Architecture
++
